# Umicom Notes practice model | Sammy Hegab, Umicom Foundation | MIT
application umicom.notes.practice
version 1.0.0
component window window -
property window title "Umicom Notes - practice workspace"
property window width 800
property window height 600
component content pane window
property content spacing 12
component heading label content
property heading text "Write a draft, then count its characters. Closing discards the draft."
component title text content
property title text "Workshop plan"
property title placeholder "Note title"
component notes editor content
property notes text "Prepare the Notes exercise."
property notes wrap true
component count button content
property count title "Count characters"
property count action text.count
property count source notes
property count target result
component result label content
property result text "Choose Count characters after editing the draft."
